35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The admin retirements are a crisis. We cannot afford the gap.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The peak season cutover is impossible. We have no freeze window.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The invoices show add-ons climbing yearly. The bundled price is stable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Last winter's outage was unowned for two days. That is unacceptable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades. It is aging in place.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if we can't freeze, we need a phased approach.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
