43,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, yes. And the warehouse rules changed twice last year.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, the data lift in 2018 took a year to fix.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need a vendor who stays for the rollout.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The calendar is the biggest hurdle. November to January is dead.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I prefer the fixed configuration. It limits the add-on creep.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,A regional team might be better than scattered suppliers.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,On-premise might be safer for the dispatch tool history.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
